            "budget": "high",
            "max_tokens": 32768,
            "include_chunks": true,
            "max_chunk_tokens": 16384,
            "include_entities": false
          },
          "notes": "What AMB's memory-bank provider sends for LoCoMo (`_recall_kwargs`); BEAM uses max_tokens 12288 and max_chunk_tokens 8192. Recorded for reference, not a shootout policy."
        },
        "item_mapping": "recall results in memory-bank's rank order: world and experience facts -> type fact, observations -> type observation, text = AMB `_format_result` ('**[type]** text' plus an occurred/mentioned line); with include_chunks, each chunk follows the first fact that cites it as a type chunk item (AMB inlines it there). valid_from/valid_to stay null: occurred_start/occurred_end are when an event happened, not a validity window, so they live in the text."
      },
